      "text": "Fig 10, 'Example of outputs from this chapter'. A table whose rows are the DHSC vision (consistent and timely access to quality medicines through a seamless, technology-enabled supply chain), three strategic goals (system-driven processes, interoperability, traceability of all health products), six strategic objectives with targets such as automating 80% of central warehouse operations, and a four-year strategic roadmap from digitalizing the central warehouse in year 1 to batch traceability in year 4.",
